{"title":"2011 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 15","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_OmegaLearn\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by OmegaLearn</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_1_by_SpreadTheMathLove\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution 1 by SpreadTheMathLove</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_WhyMath\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by WhyMath</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_15&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>How many digits are in the product <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/4/ad419b87bb0a778c0e788c05cc5b479003a2f6f7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4^5 \\cdot 5^{10}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"55\" height=\"17\" />?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/6/4/a64337a9abb841994614289cf5175664c84aabab.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A) } 8 \\qquad\\textbf{(B) } 9 \\qquad\\textbf{(C) } 10 \\qquad\\textbf{(D) } 11 \\qquad\\textbf{(E) } 12$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"382\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_OmegaLearn\">Video Solution by OmegaLearn</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_15&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by OmegaLearn\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/rQUwNC0gqdg?t=440\">https://youtu.be/rQUwNC0gqdg?t=440</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_15&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/9/2/392430c74acdb7141b3e5030628d63655e9dbfbb.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[4^5 \\cdot 5^{10} = 2^{10} \\cdot 5^{10} = 10^{10}.\\]\" width=\"196\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p>That is one <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> followed by ten <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/1/bc1f9d9bf8a1b606a4188b5ce9a2af1809e27a89.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />'s, which is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/d/1/dd1b2b6544dbff5f036b694b6206e85287105aa6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(D)}\\ 11}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"65\" height=\"28\" /> digits.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_15&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/8/81857af0dfe8c24f28ddc0a500259da537b890d5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4^5$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" /> has <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/c/c7cab1a05e1e0c1d51a6a219d96577a16b7abf9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> digits while <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/5/f/c5f680cdba5c60df18ad474bed509fa6e39a3759.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5^{10}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"25\" height=\"17\" /> has <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/a/e0a0db32027a732ac57d37ef2ae9bb150f65b108.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> digits. This means that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/4/ad419b87bb0a778c0e788c05cc5b479003a2f6f7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4^5 \\cdot 5^{10}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"55\" height=\"17\" /> has a total of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/f/1/cf15dcb6fa2c2dc5ab93c05c94603ff6924c12a6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7+4=\\boxed{\\textbf{(D)} 11}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"125\" height=\"30\" /> digits.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_1_by_SpreadTheMathLove\">Video Solution 1 by SpreadTheMathLove</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_15&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution 1 by SpreadTheMathLove\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=mYn6tNxrWBU\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=mYn6tNxrWBU</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_WhyMath\">Video Solution by WhyMath</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_15&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by WhyMath\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/q7AUTz2i938\">https://youtu.be/q7AUTz2i938</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_15&amp;action=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_8\" title=\"2011 AMC 8\">2011 AMC 8</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_8_Problems\" title=\"2011 AMC 8 Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_8_Answer_Key\" title=\"2011 AMC 8 Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=42&amp;year=2011\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\